## BLOCKERS / NOTES
- `20260828120000_d10_admin_dispute_gate.sql` is frozen once the Supabase integration applies it: correct it with a newer timestamped migration, never in place.
- The `service_role` revoke above is load-bearing. A later migration that drops and recreates the function without repeating it silently restores the platform default grant.
- `public.ordine_contestazione_risolvi` is deployed and frozen. It must not be granted to `authenticated`; the D10 door is the only browser path to it.
- The D10 grid is destructive and local-only. It suspends `audit_log_no_delete` and `wine_price_observations_no_delete` for scoped deletes and re-enables them; never execute it against production.
- Readiness debt unchanged: external AI provider OFF, payments/provider/payout scheduler OFF, refund OFF, final legal text pending, Phase 13 cutover not started.
- `.wslconfig` and `.d3b-production-schema.sql` are unrelated local files and must remain preserved and unstaged.
